## Web-to-presentation translation

When translating these patterns to a slide or document:

- The web canvas colour `{{surface_color_hex}}` becomes the slide background.
- The web max-width container becomes a slide content area with ~4–6% horizontal margin.
- The header logo becomes a small logo in the top-left or top-right of every slide.
- The web hero pattern becomes the cover slide.
- CTA buttons translate to pill-shaped buttons with the primary colour fill.

## What's missing from this file

This file was built from observed website layouts only. It does not include:

- Footer specifications beyond what the website footer shows
- Specific grid measurements unless stated as CSS values
- Print or document specifications

If your brand has explicit layout rules (margin sizes, grid systems, footer formats, slide-specific anatomy), add them to this file directly or upload the brand book and re-run `brand-skill-builder`.
